# r1108cge boot 1: full pack, group A superflat, Common 11-08 00:01 (prep_srv.sh swaps it in). Probes copied into
# kubejs/server_scripts: zz_cge_probe.js (/zgv), zz_cc_seqasm_probe.js (/zsa). SQ-CGE-01 to -04, SQ-CPP-01 to -03.
# The Create Gravity rows read Create Gravity's biome list BEFORE any /reload first: the mod builds that list only on
# TagsUpdatedEvent, and returns early while its server config is not loaded (suspected cause of SQ-CCO-08).
pace 2

## SQ-CGE-01 | boots, no mixin error naming the Create Gravity mixins
bootreject Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException
bootreject (?i)(CreateGravityEntitiesMixin|CreateGravityDimensionMixin).*(error|fail|warn)
bootreject outside the tested range.*create_gravity
bootexpect Done \(
look Done line present; no WARN/ERROR naming either Create Gravity mixin

## SQ-CGE-02a | Create Gravity's biome lookup on a fresh boot, before any /reload
> execute in minecraft:the_end run forceload add 0 0
> zgv cfg the_end 0 70 0
> zgv cfg overworld 0 -60 0
waitlog \[zgv\] cfg dim=minecraft:overworld 10
look config=null on the End before any reload = Create Gravity's list is not built on a dedicated server (third-party bug); factor=-0.8 = built

## SQ-CGE-02b | falling block, item, TNT drop in the End vs the overworld (state as booted)
> zgv drop the_end 0 120 0
waitlog \[zgv\] drop done dim=minecraft:the_end 20
> zgv drop overworld 0 120 0
waitlog \[zgv\] drop done dim=minecraft:overworld 20
look t=40 drops: End under 40 percent of overworld (about 20); overworld about 27 (vanilla)

## SQ-CGE-02c | the same after Create Gravity's list is built (/reload fires TagsUpdatedEvent)
> reload
sleep 8
> zgv cfg the_end 0 70 0
waitlog \[zgv\] cfg dim=minecraft:the_end 10
> zgv drop the_end 0 120 0
waitlog \[zgv\] drop done dim=minecraft:the_end 20
> zgv drop overworld 0 120 0
waitlog \[zgv\] drop done dim=minecraft:overworld 20
expect \[zgv\] cfg dim=minecraft:the_end .*factor=-0\.8
look t=40 End drops about 20 percent of overworld for all three types; overworld about 27

## SQ-CGE-03 | item and TNT in the End (covered by the drop lines of 02b / 02c: type=item.minecraft.stone, entity.minecraft.tnt)
> say CGE03 see SQ-CGE-02c
look judged from SQ-CGE-02c lines of the item and TNT types

## SQ-CGE-04 | resting entities in the End: no upward drift, landed block becomes a block
> execute in minecraft:the_end run fill -2 60 -2 10 60 2 minecraft:obsidian
> execute in minecraft:the_end run fill -2 61 -2 10 70 2 minecraft:air
> zgv watch the_end 0 63 0 180
waitlog \[zgv\] watch done dim=minecraft:the_end 20
> execute in minecraft:the_end run data get block 0 61 0
> execute in minecraft:the_end run kill @e[tag=zgv]
look item y stays 61.000 after landing (no climb), falling block removed=true and block 0 61 0 is sand; tnt rests on 61

## SQ-CGE-02d | gravity on living entities after the list is built (compare with SQ-CCO-08)
> execute in minecraft:the_end run summon minecraft:villager 0 70 4 {NoAI:1b,PersistenceRequired:1b,Tags:["cge02v"]}
> summon minecraft:villager 3 -59 3 {NoAI:1b,PersistenceRequired:1b,Tags:["cge02o"]}
sleep 6
> execute in minecraft:the_end run attribute @e[tag=cge02v,limit=1] forge:entity_gravity get
> attribute @e[tag=cge02o,limit=1] forge:entity_gravity get
> kill @e[tag=cge02v]
> kill @e[tag=cge02o]
look End villager 0.016, overworld 0.08

## SQ-CPP-01 | mixin and tag checks, tags, Common config pack values
bootreject ClassNotFoundException.*(creativecommon|creativeengineering)
> zq itemtag creativecommon:metal_dusts
> zq itemtag creativecommon:bark
shell grep -c "Failed to load tag\|Couldn't load tag" logs/latest.log
shell grep -n "removed\|overrides" config/creativecommon-common.toml | cut -c1-100
look metal_dusts lists IE dusts and zinc grit; bark lists IW barks; 0 tag load failures; config holds the 3 removed effects and the name list

## SQ-CPP-02 | sequenced assembly keeps enchantments and name; potion recipes load
> zsa creativeequipment:createsequencedassembly/echo_shovel_sequenced_assembly
waitlog \[zsa\] done 20
> zsa selftest
waitlog \[zsa\] done 60
look result keeps Unbreaking III and the name; selftest 0 fail

## SQ-CPP-03 | IE bottling and refinery potion recipes
> zsa bottle minecraft:swiftness
waitlog \[zsa\] done 20
> zsa refine minecraft:swiftness
waitlog \[zsa\] done 20
look bottling REGULAR swiftness -> creativebrewing:iebottling/create_potion/minecraft_swiftness_regular; refinery -> lingering
